meta {
  name: 15. Admin Get Live Card Rates
  type: http
  seq: 15
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/cards/rates?amountNgn=10000&amountUsd=10
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  # Admin Get Live Card Rates

  Returns fresh Maplerad NGN-to-USD and USD-to-NGN quotes together with the
  currently configured BillXpress exchange markups.

  ## Endpoint

  `GET /api/v1/admin/cards/rates`

  Optional query parameters:

  - `amountNgn`: NGN example amount. Defaults to `10000`.
  - `amountUsd`: USD example amount. Defaults to `10`.

  ## Frontend Use

  Show these values beside the exchange-markup fields on the admin card
  settings screen:

  - Maplerad's current provider rate
  - configured markup percentage
  - markup amount for the example
  - effective rate shown/charged to the customer
  - timestamp when the rate was fetched

  Add a `Refresh live rate` button because provider rates can change at any
  time. Do not save the live provider rate in card settings; save only the
  markup percentage.

  The provider rate in this response is admin-only. The mobile app must receive
  and display only the effective customer rate returned by its card quote.

  ## Example Response

  ```json
  {
    "rates": {
      "fetchedAt": "2026-07-06T16:00:00.000Z",
      "settings": {
        "fundingExchangeMarkupPercent": 1,
        "withdrawalExchangeMarkupPercent": 1
      },
      "funding": {
        "direction": "NGN_TO_USD",
        "input": {
          "currency": "NGN",
          "amount": 10000
        },
        "outputBeforeCharges": {
          "currency": "USD",
          "amount": 6.94
        },
        "providerRate": {
          "ngnPerUsd": 1440.92,
          "display": "1 USD = NGN 1440.92"
        },
        "configuredMarkup": {
          "percent": 1,
          "amountNgn": 100
        },
        "effectiveCustomerRate": {
          "ngnPerUsd": 1455.33,
          "display": "1 USD costs NGN 1455.33"
        }
      }
    }
  }
  ```
}
